<title>USA: DCX Inc Q1 shr loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>DCX Inc Q1 shr loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKTOWN, Colo. 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended</p>
<p>							  December 31</p>
<p>						     1996	     1995</p>
<p> Net sales				    $865,112	 $904,311</p>
<p> Net loss				    (181,257)	  124,561</p>
<p> Net income (loss) per share		 (.04)		.03</p>
<p>Weighted, average number of shares of</p>
<p>  common stock outstanding	     4,447,692	4,105,121</p>
<p>NOTE - Q1 1996 includes an expense of $0.01 per share related to obsolete inventories and doubtful accounts receivable.</p>
<p>Q1 1995 includes a non-recurring gain of $0.02 per share for the forgiveness of debt.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
